      "range": [
        "spya-z9g0je",
        "spya-weazcy"
      ],
      "title": "Peer groups and gossip",
      "gist": "West Enders organized life around tight peer groups built on shared gossip and conversation, valuing in-group loyalty, exclusivity, and conformity far more than jobs or individual achievement."
    },
