      ],
      "range": [
        "spya-s2680p",
        "spya-zd83ts"
      ],
      "title": "Dignity without work",
      "gist": "Relational living is humanity's historical default, but living via group reputation makes everything one does reflect on the group, explaining the gossip and conformity seen in earlier societies."
    },
